msgid "About Page Settings"
msgstr "Настройки страницы «О нас»"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\product\about_settings.html:7
msgid "About Us Page"
msgstr "Страница «О нас»"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\product\about_settings.html:8
msgid ""
"Write about your shop and your market here — this is what customers see on "
"the public About page."
msgstr ""
